.build/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.xcodeproj

# Elthen's sprite sheet is fetched at build time, never committed: the author's
# terms allow using the sprites in a project but forbid passing the assets
# themselves on, and a public repository does exactly that.
# See scripts/fetch-optional-assets.sh and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
Sources/CodeCatApp/Skins/elthen/

# The spec-driven-development record is kept on purpose: per-task briefs, the
# reports the subagents wrote back, and the progress ledger. See
# docs/how-this-was-built.md. Everything else the tooling leaves behind is not.
.superpowers/*
!.superpowers/sdd/
# The saved review diffs are the one exception: they are `git diff` output,
# reproducible from the history they were taken against, and half a megabyte of it.
.superpowers/sdd/*.diff
